## 5. 실행 방법

### 5.1 스크립트 실행

```bash
# core (Linux)
core/perf/run_benchmarks_multi.sh [options]

# core (Windows PowerShell)
core/perf/run_benchmarks_multi.ps1 [options]

# bindings (Linux, 예: python)
